cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "llama-annotation-pipeline: Reproducible Snakemake workflow for homology-based and ab initio annotation of the Lama glama genome"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow that annotates a Lama glama genome assembly by DNA-based
  lift-over (Liftoff) and protein-to-genome alignment (miniprot) from a Vicugna
  pacos reference, and benchmarks the resulting proteomes with BUSCO, AGAT and
  gffcompare.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Juan F."
    family-names: "Priego"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2103-6835"
    affiliation: "Universidad de Castilla-La Mancha (UCLM)"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-18"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/JFKanela/llama-annotation-pipeline"
keywords:
  - genome annotation
  - Lama glama
  - Vicugna pacos
  - Snakemake
  - Liftoff
  - miniprot
  - BUSCO
  - comparative genomics
